msgstr "Ẹ̀yà RRDtool tí o ti fi sí i."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Gradient Support"
msgstr "Mú Àtìlẹ́yìn Ìyípadà Àwọ̀ Ṣiṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enabled Gradient Support for AREA and STACK charts."
msgstr "Mú Àtìlẹ́yìn Ìyípadà Àwọ̀ ṣiṣẹ́ fún àwọn àwòrán ìtànkálẹ̀ AREA àti STACK."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Àṣẹ Àwòrán"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà mẹ́rin ló wà fún ṣíṣe ìpinnu Àwọn Àṣẹ Àwòrán Olùṣàmúlò. Àkọ́kọ́ ni 'Oníyọ̀ọ̀da'. Labẹ́ ìṣètò 'Oníyọ̀ọ̀da', Olùṣàmúlò nílò àǹfààní sí Àwòrán, Ẹ̀rọ tàbí Àdàkọ Àwòrán nìkan láti ní àǹfààní sí àwọn Àwòrán tí ó bá wọn mu. Labẹ́ 'Oníhámọ́', Olùṣàmúlò gbọ́dọ̀ ní àǹfààní sí Àwòrán, Ẹ̀rọ, àti Àdàkọ Àwòrán láti ní àǹfààní sí Àwòrán náà. Àwọn ọ̀nà méjì àkọ́kọ́ yìí ní ìṣòro ìfẹ̀sí fún àwọn ìfisílẹ̀ tí ó tóbi púpọ̀. Nítorí náà, àwọn àṣàyàn àfikún méjì wà. Wọ́n jẹ́ 'Dá lórí Ẹ̀rọ', èyí tí ó túmọ̀ sí pé bí o bá ní àǹfààní sí Ẹ̀rọ náà, o óò ní àǹfààní sí àwọn Àwòrán rẹ̀. Àti ní ìkẹyìn 'Dá lórí Àdàkọ Àwòrán', èyí tí ó túmọ̀ sí pé bí o bá ní àǹfààní sí 'Àdàkọ Àwòrán' o óò ní àǹfààní sí gbogbo Àwòrán Ẹ̀rọ ti Àdàkọ yẹn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Oníyọ̀ọ̀da"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Oníhámọ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Dá lórí Ẹ̀rọ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Ìṣẹ̀dá Àwòrán/Orísun Dátà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Tí a bá ṣètò rẹ̀ sí Rọrùn, a lè ṣẹ̀dá Àwòrán àti Orísun Dátà láti inú Àwòrán Tuntun nìkan. Tí ó bá jẹ́ Gbòòrò, ìṣẹ̀dá Àwòrán àti Orísun Dátà ti àtẹ̀yìnwá yóò ṣiṣẹ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Rọrùn"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Gbòòrò"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Fi Ìrànlọ́wọ́ Fọ́ọ̀mù/Ìṣètò Hàn Nínú Ìlà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Tí a bá fọwọ́ sí i, a óò fi Ìrànlọ́wọ́ Fọ́ọ̀mù àti Ìṣètò hàn nínú ìlà. Bí kò bá rí bẹ́ẹ̀, a óò fi í hàn nígbà tí o bá gbé kọ́sọ̀ sórí bọ́tìnì ìrànlọ́wọ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Ìrànlọ́wọ́ Ojú-ìwé Abẹ́lé Nìkan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Ní àìyípadà, ìrànlọ́wọ́ ojú-ìwé Cacti wà ní docs.cacti.net. Àmọ́, bí ètò rẹ kò bá ní àǹfààní sí Íńtánẹ́ẹ̀tì, o lè ṣe ìgbàsílẹ̀ ìwé-àkọsílẹ̀ náà sí orí kọ̀ǹpútà ní ìrísí HTML kí o sì fi sí ibi 'docs' lórí sẹ́fà Cacti rẹ. Tí o bá yan láti lo ibi abẹ́lé nìkan fún ìwé-àkọsílẹ̀ ìrànlọ́wọ́ ojú-ìwé, fọwọ́ sí àpótí àyẹ̀wò yìí."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Ìjẹ́rìísí Ìparẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Bi olùṣàmúlò kí a tó pa nǹkan rẹ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Ìṣètò Àṣàyàn Ìpamọ́ Orísun Dátà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ṣí i sílẹ̀, Cacti yóò ṣètò Bọ́tìnì Rédíò láti Pa àwọn Orísun Dátà tí ó jẹ mọ́ Àwòrán rẹ́ nígbà tí a bá ń yọ Àwòrán kúrò. Àkíyèsí: Cacti kò ní gba ìyọkúrò Orísun Dátà láàyè tí a bá ń lò wọ́n nínú Àwòrán mìíràn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Ìṣísílẹ̀ Àwòrán Lọ́nà Àdáṣe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ṣí i sílẹ̀, Cacti kò ní tì àwọn Àwòrán pa. Èyí ń jẹ́ kí àtúnṣe ọwọ́ ti Orísun Dátà tí ó jẹ mọ́ Àwòrán yára sí i."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Fi Pátákó Ìṣàkóso Cacti Pamọ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Fún lílò pẹ̀lú Àtìlẹ́yìn Ìjápọ̀ Òde ti Cacti. Nípa lílo ìṣètò yìí, o lè fi Pátákó Ìṣàkóso Cacti pamọ́, kí o lè fi ojú-ìwé tìrẹ nìkan hàn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Ṣí Fífà-àti-Jù-sílẹ̀ Sílẹ̀"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Àwọn ojú-ọ̀nà Cacti kan ń ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn Fífà-àti-Jù-sílẹ̀. Tí a bá fọwọ́ sí i, àṣàyàn yìí yóò wà ní ṣíṣí sílẹ̀. Àkíyèsí: Fún olùṣàmúlò tí ó ní ìṣòro ìríran, a lè pa àṣàyàn yìí."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Ààbò Ojú-òpó"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Fi Ipá Mú Àwọn Ìsopọ̀ Lórí HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá fọwọ́ sí i, gbogbo ìgbìyànjú láti wọ Cacti ni a óò darí sí HTTPS láti rí ààbò tó lágbára dájú."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Gba Olùkójọ Dátà Òkèèrè HTTPS Aláìléwu Láyè"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Gba lílo Àwọn Ìwé-ẹ̀rí Tí A Fọwọ́ Sí Fúnra-ẹni láyè kí o sì gba orúkọ olùgbàlejò ti Ìwé-ẹ̀rí náà láyè láti yàtọ̀ sí ti Olùkójọ Dátà Òkèèrè."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Gba Àwọn Lẹ́tà Àkànṣe Aláìléwu Láyè nínú Àwọn Ọ̀nà Ìtẹ̀wọlé Dátà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Ní ìtàn àtẹ̀yìnwá, àwọn olùṣàkóso Cacti ṣẹ̀dá Àwọn Ọ̀nà Ìtẹ̀wọlé Dátà tó rọrùn tí ó ní àwọn àṣẹ bíi \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" láti ṣàpẹẹrẹ iye nọ́ńbà fún lílò nínú Àwọn Gíráàfù Cacti.  Nínú àwọn ẹ̀dà Cacti ti ìṣáájú, a gba èyí láyè.  Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, èyí jẹ́ ìṣe tí kò ní ààbò nítorí pé ó jẹ́ ọ̀nà fún àwọn olùlò ẹni-kẹta láti tẹ Àwọn Àdàkọ Dátà tí kò ní ààbò jáde.  Nínú Cacti ìgbàlódé, ó yẹ kí a yẹra fún irú àwọn ìṣe wọ̀nyí.  Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, a pèsè àṣàyàn yìí tí o bá ní Àwọn Ọ̀nà Ìtẹ̀wọlé Dátà àtijọ́ tí ó ní àwọn Lẹ́tà Àkànṣe aláìléwu wọ̀nyí tí o kò sì tíì yí wọn padà sí ìwé-àṣẹ àdúgbò nínú àkójọpọ̀ fáìlì 'scripts'.  Nígbà tí a kò bá yan àṣàyàn yìí, Cacti yóò dínà àwọn lẹ́tà àkànṣe bíi ti shell gẹ́gẹ́ bí àmì àsọyé, àkámọ́ kọ́lí, ìlà títọ́, ìlà sẹ́yìn, àti àmì backtick.  Cacti ń bá a lọ láti gba àwọn àmì tóbi-jù àti kéré-jù láyè fún àwọn nǹkan bíi <path_cacti> àti fún àwọn òṣùwọ̀n ìtẹ̀wọlé, ṣùgbọ́n bí a kò bá yan àṣàyàn yìí, ìyẹn ni òpin ìlò wọn tí a gbà láyè."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Ìlànà Ìwé-àṣẹ Ààbò-Àkóónú"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Ṣàkóso ìlànà script-src CSP.  Nínú Àwọn Ipo Nonce, Àwọn Àfikún (Plugins) Cacti tí ó ń lo JavaScript lórí ìlà gbọ́dọ̀ ní àbùdá nonce láti inú iṣẹ́ abẹ́nú Cacti 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́, aṣàwákiri yóò dí àwọn ìwé-àṣẹ wọ̀nyí lọ́nà.  Lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́, Cacti kàn ń gba ìjábọ̀ láyè lórí Àwọn Àfikún Cacti tí kò lo Ipo Nonce dáadáa.  Ní ọjọ́ iwájú, a óò gba Àwọn Olùṣàkóso láyè láti dí irú àwọn àfikún bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ́nà láti lo JavaScript lórí ìlà wọn bí wọn kò bá lo Nonces."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Gba JavaScript Lórí Ìlà Tí Kò Ní Nonce Láyè"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Gba méjèèjì unsafe-eval àti JavaScript Lórí Ìlà Tí Kò Ní Nonce Láyè"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Ipo Nonce - Ìjábọ̀ Nìkan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI Ìjábọ̀ Ìrúfin CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL ibi tí àwọn aṣàwákiri ti ń fi POST ránṣẹ́ sí àwọn ìjábọ̀ ìrúfin CSP ní àwọn ipo nonce-report àti nonce. Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo láti lo <url_path>/csp_report.php. Gbọ́dọ̀ ní àwọn lẹ́tà URL aláàbò nìkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Àwọn Orísun Mìíràn ti Ààbò Àkóónú (Content-Security)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Àwọn orúkọ domain tí a fi ààyè pín tí a ó gbà láàyè láti wọlé sí níta Olùpèsè Wẹ́ẹ̀bù fúnra rẹ̀.  Èyí ṣe pàtàkì fún àwọn olùmúlò tí ó bá yan láti lo CDN, tàbí ojú-òpó ìgbàlejò.  Àwọn orísun lè ní àwọn àmì aṣojú bíi àpẹẹrẹ: *.mydomain.com, tàbí ìlànà ìbánisọ̀rọ̀, bíi àpẹẹrẹ: https://*.example.com.  Àwọn Orísun Yòókù wọ̀nyí ní Àwòrán, CSS àti irú JavaScript nìkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL ibi tí àwọn aṣàwárí ń fi ìròyìn ìrúfin CSP ránṣẹ́ sí ní ipò nonce-report àti nonce. Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo láti lo /cacti/csp_report.php ní gbòǹgbò ìfi-sísẹ́. Ó gbọ́dọ̀ ní àwọn àmì-ọ̀rọ̀ URL tí ó láàbò nìkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Mú Ìṣẹ̀dá Àwòrán Lọ́nà Àìfọwọ́yí Ṣiṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá pa á, Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni Cacti kì yóò ṣẹ̀dá Àwòrán kankan lọ́nà ìṣiṣẹ́. Èyí wúlò nígbà tí o bá ń ṣàtúnṣe àwọn ètò Ẹ̀rọ láti yẹra fún ṣíṣẹ̀dá àwọn Àwòrán tuntun ní gbogbo ìgbà tí o bá fi nǹkan pamọ́. Pípè Àwọn Òfin Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni lọ́wọ́ yóò ṣì ṣeé ṣe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Mú Ìṣẹ̀dá Ohun Igi Lọ́nà Àìfọwọ́yí Ṣiṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá pa á, Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni Cacti kì yóò ṣẹ̀dá Ohun Igi kankan lọ́nà ìṣiṣẹ́. Èyí wúlò nígbà tí o bá ń ṣàtúnṣe àwọn ètò Ẹ̀rọ tàbí Àwòrán láti yẹra fún ṣíṣẹ̀dá àwọn Àkọsílẹ̀ Igi tuntun ní gbogbo ìgbà tí o bá fi nǹkan pamọ́. Pípè Àwọn Òfin lọ́wọ́ yóò ṣì ṣeé ṣe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Ìmeèlì Ìfitónilétí Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni Sí"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Àdírẹ́sì Ìmeèlì láti fi àwọn Ìmeèlì Ìfitónilétí Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni ránṣẹ́ sí bí a kò bá tọ́ka rẹ̀ ní ìpele Nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni. Bí a bá fi pápá yìí, tàbí iye Nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni sílẹ̀ ní òfo, Cacti yóò lo àkọọ́lẹ̀ Ìmeèlì Àkọ́kọ́ ti Àwọn Olùṣàkóso Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Orúkọ Olùránṣẹ́ Ìfitónilétí Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Orúkọ Ìmeèlì láti lò fún àwọn Ìmeèlì Ìfitónilétí Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni bí a kò bá tọ́ka rẹ̀ ní ìpele Nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni. Bí a bá fi pápá yìí, tàbí iye Nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni sílẹ̀ ní òfo, Cacti yóò lo Orúkọ Olùránṣẹ́ àìyípadà ti ètò."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Ìmeèlì Olùránṣẹ́ Ìfitónilétí Ìṣiṣẹ́-fúnra-ẹni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì Ímeèlì láti lò fún Àwọn Ímeèlì Ìfitónilétí Automation bí kò bá ti jẹ́ sísọ pàtó ní ìpele Automation Network. Bí a bá fi ààyè yìí tàbí iye Automation Network sí òfo, Cacti yóò lo Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì Ímeèlì Látọ̀dọ̀ àìyípadà ti ètò."

