#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Color to use for business hours"
msgstr "Àwọ̀ láti lò fún àwọn wákàtí iṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Àwọ̀ tí a óò fi hàn fún àwọn wákàtí iṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of days to show business hours"
msgstr "Iye ọjọ́ tó pọ̀ jù lọ láti fi àwọn wákàtí iṣẹ́ hàn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "After this number of days, the business hours will not be added to the graph. <br/>Recommended: 62 days"
msgstr "Lẹ́yìn iye ọjọ́ yìí, a kò ní fi àwọn wákàtí iṣẹ́ kún àtẹ náà mọ́. <br/>Ìdámọ̀ràn: ọjọ́ 62"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Ìkójọpọ̀ Dátà Ti Ṣiṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Tí o bá fẹ́ dá ìlànà ìṣèwádìí dúró pátápátá, yọ àmì kúrò nínú àpótí yìí."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Irú Olùṣèwádìí"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Irú olùṣèwádìí láti lò.  Ètò yìí yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í ṣiṣẹ́ ní àlàfo ìṣèwádìí tó kàn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Àlàfo Ìṣàṣọ̀kan Olùṣèwádìí"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Àlàfo ìṣàṣọ̀kan ìṣèwádìí àìyípadà láti lò nígbà tí a bá ń ṣẹ̀dá olùṣèwádìí kan.  Ètò yìí yóò nípa lórí bí a ṣe ń ṣàyẹ̀wò àti ṣàtúnṣe àwọn olùṣèwádìí òkèèrè tó."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Àlàfo ìṣèwádìí tí à ń lò.  Ètò yìí yóò nípa lórí bí a ṣe ń ṣàyẹ̀wò àti ṣàtúnṣe àwọn fáìlì RRDfiles tó.  <strong><u>ÀKÍYÈSÍ: Tí o bá yí iye yìí padà, o gbọ́dọ̀ tún àkójọ ìpamọ́ olùṣèwádìí kún.  Àìṣe bẹ́ẹ̀ lè yọrí sí pípàdánù dátà.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Àlàfo Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ìgbàgbogbo tí olùkójọ dátà Cacti yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀.  O lè lo crontab, iṣẹ́ tí a ṣètò (fún windows), tàbí iṣẹ́ systemd cactid láti ṣàkóso bíbẹ̀rẹ̀ olùkójọ dátà Cacti.  Fún àwọn ìtọ́ni lórí lílo daemon cactid, ṣàgbéyẹ̀wò fáìlì README.md nínú fódà iṣẹ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Ṣe Ìwọ̀ntúnwọ̀nsì Ẹrù Iṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Tí o bá yan àṣàyàn yìí, Cacti yóò gbìyànjú láti ṣe ìwọ̀ntúnwọ̀nsì ẹrù iṣẹ́ olùṣèwádìí kọ̀ọ̀kan nípa pípín àwọn ohun olùṣèwádìí déédéé fún iṣẹ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ìbú Àbájáde Àtúnṣe-àṣìṣe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Tí o bá yan àṣàyàn yìí, Cacti yóò ṣàyẹ̀wò fún àbájáde tó kọjá agbára Cacti láti fi pamọ́, yóò sì fúnni ní ìkìlọ̀ nígbà tí ó bá rí i."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìparí Aṣojú Òkèèrè"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Iye àkókò, ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá, tí olùpèsè wẹ́ẹ̀bù Cacti Àárín yóò dúró fún ìdáhùn láti ọ̀dọ̀ Olùkójọ Dátà Ọ̀nà Jíjìn láti gba oríṣiríṣi ìròyìn Ẹ̀rọ kí ó tó fi ìbéèrè náà sílẹ̀. Lórí àwọn Ẹ̀rọ tí ó ní ìbáṣepọ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn Olùkójọ Dátà mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí Olùkójọ Dátà Cacti Àárín, a gbọ́dọ̀ lo Aṣojú Ọ̀nà Jíjìn láti kó ìròyìn Ẹ̀rọ jọ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Sọ Tábìlì Olùṣèwádìí Dọ̀tun Ní Ìyípo Kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Ètò yìí wà fún àwọn ètò olùṣèwádìí kan ṣoṣo nìkan láti tún tábìlì àbájáde olùṣèwádìí kọ́ ní ìyípo ìṣèwádìí kọ̀ọ̀kan láti dènà kí tábìlì ìrántí má baà ṣe pàṣípààrọ̀ (swap) lórí àwọn ètò ńlá pẹ̀lú àwọn ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà ńlá tí ó lè lo swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Pa Ìṣàtúnṣe-ẹ̀dà Àkójọ Ìpamọ́ Ohun-èlò"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ àìṣàtúnṣe, Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Cacti pàtàkì yóò fi gbogbo ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù àti àwọn àfikún pamọ́ sínú Àkójọpọ̀ Ohun Èlò (Resource Cache). Lẹ́yìn náà, lẹ́ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan àwọn Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Látòkèèrè yóò máa ṣe àtúnṣe ara wọn pẹ̀lú èyíkéyìí àtúnṣe láti ọ̀dọ̀ Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Cacti pàtàkì. Àkójọpọ̀ Ohun Èlò yìí ń jẹ́ kí àwọn Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Látòkèèrè lè ṣe àgbéga fúnra wọn. Tí o kò bá fẹ́ lo àṣàyàn yìí, o lè pa á nípa lílo ètò yìí."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Ìhùwàsí SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Àtìlẹ́yìn Aṣojú SNMP Ti Ṣiṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Bí a bá ṣàmì sí àṣàyàn yìí, Cacti yóò fi àwọn ìwífún nípa ẹ̀rọ àti ètò Cacti kún àwọn tábìlì Aṣojú SNMP. Kò mú Aṣojú SNMP fúnra rẹ̀ ṣiṣẹ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Mú MD5 àti DES ṣiṣẹ́ fún SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Àwọn algoridimu ìjẹ́rìísí MD5 àti àṣírí DES jẹ́ ti àtijọ́, aláìlágbára, wọn kò sì sí lórí àwọn ìkọ́lé PHP àti Net-SNMP tí a fún lágbára (FIPS). Nígbà tí a bá pa á, MD5 àti DES yóò kúrò nínú àwọn àṣàyàn Ìlànà Ìjẹ́rìísí àti Àṣírí SNMPv3 tí a ń fi hàn nígbà tí a bá ń ṣàtúnṣe Ẹ̀rọ àti nínú Àwọn Àṣàyàn SNMP Automation, tí yóò fi àwọn algoridimu SHA àti AES tó lágbára jù nìkan sílẹ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Mú Àpamọ́ Ìwé-ẹ̀rí (Credential Cache) Ṣiṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Ṣètò tẹ́lẹ̀ kí o sì fi àwọn àríyànjiyàn ìwé-ẹ̀rí SNMPv3 pamọ́ sínú àpamọ́ (cache) lẹ́ẹ̀kan fún ìyípadà ìwé-ẹ̀rí kọ̀ọ̀kan kí ìlànà olùkójọpọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan lè tún un lò dípò kí ó tún un kọ́ lórí ìbéèrè kọ̀ọ̀kan. Èyí ń fúnni ní ìfowópamọ́ díẹ̀ nígbà tí a bá ń kó dátà jọ pẹ̀lú àwọn ìwé-ẹ̀rí SNMPv3 nípasẹ̀ àwọn fáìlì Net-SNMP. Àfikún php-snmp ń ṣàkóso ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìbéèrè get ti SNMPv3 nínú ìlànà rẹ̀ ó sì ń fo àpamọ́ yìí kọjá, ṣùgbọ́n àwọn fáìlì Net-SNMP (àti nítorí náà àpamọ́ yìí) ṣì ń ṣiṣẹ́ fún àwọn ìrìn SNMP (walks), àbájáde hex, àwọn ìbéèrè tí ó ń ṣètò àkóónú (context) tàbí engine id, àti àwọn àkópọ̀ ìlànà tí ẹ̀yà PHP tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ kò ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún. Mú èyí ṣiṣẹ́ bí o bá ń kó èyíkéyìí nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ wọ̀nyẹn jọ pẹ̀lú àwọn ìwé-ẹ̀rí SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Ààlà SNMP Get OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Iye tó pọ̀ jùlọ àìyípadà ti Àwọn OID SNMP Get láti fi ránṣẹ́ fún ìbéèrè snmpget kọ̀ọ̀kan. Fún Àwọn Ẹ̀rọ, a ń ṣàkóso ètò yìí ní ìpele Ẹ̀rọ. O gbọ́dọ̀ lo ètò yìí nìkan nígbà tí o bá ń lo SNMP API ti Cacti ní tààrà nínú àwọn ìwé-àṣẹ̀ (scripts) tàbí àwọn àfikún (plugins) rẹ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n Ìkójọ SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Eélòó ni àwọn OID tí ó yẹ kí a dá padà fún ìbéèrè snmpbulkwalk kọ̀ọ̀kan?  Fún Àwọn Ẹ̀rọ tí ó ní igi SNMP títóbi, mímú ìwọ̀n yìí pọ̀ sí i yóò mú iṣẹ́ àtúntò atọ́ka sunwọ̀n sí i lórí WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Pa Àyẹ̀wò OID tí ń pọ̀ sí i"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Ó ń ṣàkóso pípa àyẹ̀wò fún OID tí ń pọ̀ sí i nígbà tí a bá ń rìn nínú igi OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Àwọn Ètò Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Àfikún"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Ìkọsílẹ̀ Dátà Tí Kò Tọ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Báwo ni o ṣe fẹ́ kí a kọ àwọn àṣìṣe àbájáde Akójọpọ̀ Dátà sílẹ̀? Àwọn àṣàyàn pẹ̀lú: 'Àlàyé Kíkún' tí ó ń ṣàlàyé gbogbo àṣìṣe, 'Àkótán' tí ó ń pèsè iye àwọn àṣìṣe àbájáde fún Ẹ̀rọ kọ̀ọ̀kan, àti 'Kò sí', tí kì í pèsè ìṣirò àṣìṣe."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Àkótán"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Àlàyé Kíkún"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Iye Àwọn Olùpèsè Àkọsílẹ̀ Ètò PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Iye àwọn ìlànà olùpèsè àkọsílẹ̀ ètò tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà fún ìlànà spine kọ̀ọ̀kan. Àwọn ètò láàárín 1 sí 15 ni a gbà. Ìlànà yìí yóò ṣèrànwọ́ tí o bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ àti àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ètò olùpèsè, ó sì wúlò fún Akójọpọ̀ Dátà spine nìkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Iye Àkókò Ìdádúró Àkọsílẹ̀ Ètò àti Olùpèsè Àkọsílẹ̀ Ètò"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Àkókò tó pọ̀ jù lọ tí spine yóò dúró de ìwé-àṣẹ láti parí.  Iye àkókò ìdádúró yìí wà ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá, ó sì wúlò fún Olùkójọ Dátà spine nìkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Àtúnṣe Àtọ́ka Gbogbo Ẹ̀rọ Lẹ́ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Ètò Àkókò Àtúnṣe Àtọ́ka Gbogbo Ẹ̀rọ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Báwo ni o ṣe fẹ́ kí a máa ṣe Àtúnṣe Àtọ́ka gbogbo àwọn Ẹ̀rọ léraléra tó. Àtúnṣe Àtọ́ka yìí yóò wáyé ní ọ̀gànjọ́ òru ní ìgbà tí o bá yan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Lọ́sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀ ní Ọjọ́ Àìkú"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Lóṣooṣù ní Ọjọ́ Àìkú"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Àwọn Ètò Àkókò Ìdádúró Àbẹ́lẹ̀ àti Ìlànà Ìṣiṣẹ́ Lẹ́ẹ̀kan-náà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìdádúró Ìṣẹ̀dá Ìròyìn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Iye àkókò tó pọ̀ jù lọ tí ìwé-àṣẹ Ìṣẹ̀dá Ìròyìn ti Cacti lè fi ṣiṣẹ́ láì mú àṣìṣe àkókò ìdádúró jáde àti láì jẹ́ kí a dá a dúró."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú %s"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìdádúró Ìṣirò Orísun Dátà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Iye àkókò tí ó pọ̀ jùlọ tí àkọsílẹ̀ ètò Ìṣirò Orísun Dátà ti Cacti lè fi ṣiṣẹ́ láì mú àṣìṣe àkókò ìdádúró jáde àti láì jẹ́ kí a pa á."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìdádúró RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Iye àkókò tó pọ̀ jù lọ tí ìwé-àṣẹ àyẹ̀wò RRDfile ti Cacti lè fi ṣiṣẹ́ láì mú àṣìṣe àkókò ìdádúró jáde àti láì jẹ́ kí a dá a dúró."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "Wákàtí %s"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìdádúró Àwọn Àṣẹ Olùṣàyẹ̀wò"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Iye àkókò tí ó pọ̀ jùlọ tí àkọsílẹ̀ ètò Àwọn Àṣẹ Abẹ́lẹ̀ ti Cacti lè fi ṣiṣẹ́ láì mú àṣìṣe àkókò ìdádúró jáde àti láì jẹ́ kí a pa á. Àkọsílẹ̀ ètò yìí yóò ṣe àwọn iṣẹ́ bíi àtúnṣe àtọ́ka Àwọn Ẹ̀rọ àti yíyọ àwọn ẹ̀rọ kúrò láti Àwọn Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Látòkèèrè."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Àwọn Ìlànà Àṣẹ Olùṣàyẹ̀wò Tí Ó Ń Ṣiṣẹ́ Lẹ́ẹ̀kan Náà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
