#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Ṣé kí Boost mú ìmúdójúìwọ̀n RRD lórí ìbéèrè ṣiṣẹ́ nínú Cacti? Bí o bá pa á, àyípadà yìí kò ní bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í ṣiṣẹ́ títí lẹ́yìn ìyípo ìṣàyẹ̀wò tó kàn. Nígbà tí o bá ní Àwọn Olùkójọ Dátà Òkèèrè, ètò yìí gbọ́dọ̀ wà ní títàn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Olùmúdójúìwọ̀n RRD Ìpele Ètò"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Kí a tó lè nu Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n RRD Lórí Ìbéèrè kúrò, ìṣiṣẹ́ poller kan gbọ́dọ̀ kọjá nígbà gbogbo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n Ìgbà Wo Ni Ó Yẹ Kí Boost Máa Mú Gbogbo RRD Dójúìwọ̀n"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá mú Boost ṣiṣẹ́, àwọn fáìlì RRD rẹ yóò máa di mímúdójúìwọ̀n nìkan nígbà tí olùlò bá béèrè fún wọn, tàbí nígbà tí àkókò yìí bá kọjá."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Iye Àwọn Ìlànà Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Iye àwọn ìlànà boost tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ papọ̀ láti ṣe àgbéyẹ̀wò gbogbo àwọn RRD nínú tábìlì boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Àwọn Àkọsílẹ̀ Tó Pọ̀ Jù Lọ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Bí tábìlì àbájáde boost bá ré kọjá ìwọ̀n yìí, ní iye àkọsílẹ̀, ìmúdójúìwọ̀n yóò wáyé."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Target Archive Rows Per Range"
msgstr "Àwọn Ìlà Àkójọ Àfojúsùn Fún Ààlà Kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Boost updater assigns complete Local Data IDs to contiguous ranges near this row count. A single Local Data ID is never split, so a range can exceed the target. Lower this value to reduce updater memory and query time. The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Olùṣàtúnṣe Boost ń yan àwọn ID Dátà Agbègbè pípé sí àwọn ààlà tí ó tẹ̀lé ara wọn nítòsí iye ìlà yìí. A kì í pín ID Dátà Agbègbè kan ṣoṣo láé, nítorí náà ààlà kan lè kọjá àfojúsùn náà. Dín iye yìí kù láti dín ìrántí olùṣàtúnṣe àti àkókò ìbéèrè kù. Iye àkọ́bẹ̀rẹ̀ jẹ́ 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Gígùn Àríyànjiyàn Tó Pọ̀ Jù Lọ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Nígbà tí boost bá fi àwọn àṣẹ ìmúdójúìwọ̀n ránṣẹ́ sí RRDtool, kò gbọ́dọ̀ ré kọjá Gígùn Àríyànjiyàn Tó Pọ̀ Jù Lọ ti ètò ìṣiṣẹ́. Èyí yàtọ̀ síra gẹ́gẹ́ bí ètò ìṣiṣẹ́ àti ìpele kernel. Fún àpẹẹrẹ: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ láìlópin"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Òpin Ìrántí fún Boost àti Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n ìrántí tó pọ̀ jù lọ fún Cacti Poller àti Poller Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìṣiṣẹ́ Síkíríìpù Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n RRD Tó Pọ̀ Jù Lọ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Bí boost poller bá ré kọjá àkókò ìṣiṣẹ́ yìí, a ó fi ìkìlọ̀ sí inú àkọsílẹ̀ Cacti,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRDs Queued"
msgstr "Iye Púpọ̀ Jùlọ Àwọn RRD Tí Ó Kùnà Nínú Ìlà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of RRD destinations retained for automatic Boost retry. Only the latest complete failed update is retained per destination."
msgstr "Iye púpọ̀ jùlọ ti àwọn ibi-àfojúsùn RRD tí a tọ́jú fún ìtún-gbìyànjú aládàáṣe Boost. Àtúnṣe tó kùnà pípé tó ṣẹ̀ṣẹ̀ jùlọ nìkan ni a tọ́jú fún ibi-àfojúsùn kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Failed RRD Retry Budget"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n Ìtún-gbìyànjú RRD Tí Ó Kùnà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum queued RRD destinations retried by one scheduled Boost run."
msgstr "Iye púpọ̀ jùlọ ti àwọn ibi-àfojúsùn RRD nínú ìlà tí ìṣiṣẹ́ Boost kan tí a ṣètò yóò tún gbìyànjú."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRD Retries"
msgstr "Iye Púpọ̀ Jùlọ Àwọn Ìtún-gbìyànjú RRD Tí Ó Kùnà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Queued RRD updates are explicitly discarded after this many failed automatic attempts."
msgstr "A máa ń kọ àwọn àtúnṣe RRD tí ó wà nínú ìlà sílẹ̀ ní gbangba lẹ́yìn iye ìgbìyànjú aládàáṣe tí ó kùnà yìí."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRD Age"
msgstr "Ọjọ́ Orí Púpọ̀ Jùlọ fún RRD Tí Ó Kùnà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Days to retain the latest failed RRD update before explicit discard."
msgstr "Iye ọjọ́ láti tọ́jú àtúnṣe RRD tó kùnà tó ṣẹ̀ṣẹ̀ jùlọ kí a tó kọ̀ ọ́ sílẹ̀ ní gbangba."

#: include/global_settings.php
