msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "Ìtẹ̀ka RSA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Ìtẹ̀ka kọ́kọ́rọ́ RSA gbangba lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ tí aṣojú ń lò. Èyí ṣe pàtàkì láti dá ìsopọ̀ tí a gbẹ́kẹ̀lé sílẹ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "Olùpèsè Aṣojú RRDtool - Afẹ́yìntì"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀ntúnwọ̀nsì Ẹrù"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Tí aṣojú àkọ́kọ́ àti ti afẹ́yìntì bá ṣeé gbà, àṣàyàn yìí ń gba láàyè láti pín gbogbo ìbéèrè sí RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Orúkọ olùgbàlejò DNS tàbí àdírẹ́sì IP ti olùpèsè aṣojú afẹ́yìntì RRDtool tí aṣojú bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ ní ipò MSR."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "Èbúté TCP fún ìbánisọ̀rọ̀ tí a fi ìpamọ́ bò pẹ̀lú aṣojú afẹ́yìntì."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Ìtẹ̀ka kọ́kọ́rọ́ RSA gbangba lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ tí aṣojú afẹ́yìntì ń lò. Èyí ṣe pàtàkì láti dá ìsopọ̀ tí a gbẹ́kẹ̀lé sílẹ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Àwọn Ètò Pípa Spike"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Ìyọkúrò"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà ìyọkúrò méjì ló wà. Èkíní, Ìyàtọ̀ Ìwọ̀n (Standard Deviation), yóò yọ àpẹẹrẹ èyíkéyìí tí ó jìnnà sí àròpín àwọn àpẹẹrẹ ní iye X ti ìyàtọ̀ ìwọ̀n kúrò. Ọ̀nà kejì, Ìyàtọ̀ (Variance), yóò yọ àpẹẹrẹ èyíkéyìí tí ó pọ̀ ju àròpín Ìyàtọ̀ lọ ní X% kúrò. Ọ̀nà Ìyàtọ̀ ń gba iye kan ti àwọn 'àpẹẹrẹ àjèjì' (outliers) rò. Àwọn wọ̀nyí jẹ́ àwọn àpẹẹrẹ àrà ọ̀tọ̀, bíi ìgòkè lójijì, tí ó nílò láti yọ kúrò nínú ìṣirò Àròpín Ìyàtọ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Ìyapa Àṣà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Tí Ó Dá Lórí Ìyàtọ̀ pẹ̀lú Àwọn Àpẹẹrẹ Àjèjì Tí A Yọ Kúrò"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Ìrọ́pò"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà ìrọ́pò mẹ́ta ló wà. Ọ̀nà àkọ́kọ́ ń rọ́pò òkè gíga pẹ̀lú ìpíndọ́gba orísun dátà tí a ń sọ̀rọ̀ rẹ̀. Ọ̀nà kejì ń rọ́pò òkè gíga pẹ̀lú 'NaN'. Ìkẹyìn ń rọ́pò òkè gíga pẹ̀lú ìdíyelé tó dára tí a mọ̀ kẹ́yìn tí a rí."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Ìpíndọ́gba"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "Àwọn NaN"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Tó Dára Tí A Mọ̀ Kẹ́yìn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Iye Ìyàtọ̀ Ìwọ̀n Ìbámu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Ìdíyelé èyíkéyìí tí ó bá ju ìpíndọ́gba lọ pẹ̀lú iye ìyàtọ̀ ìwọ̀n ìbámu yìí ni a ó yọ kúrò. Nọ́mbà tó dára yóò sinmi lórí irú dátà tí a ó ṣiṣẹ́ lé lórí. A dámọ̀ràn nọ́mbà tí kò kéré sí Ìyàtọ̀ Ìwọ̀n Ìbámu 5."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Ìyàtọ̀ Ìwọ̀n Ìbámu %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Ìpín Ọgọ́rùn-ún Ìyàtọ̀"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Iye yìí dúró fún ìpín ọgọ́rùn-ún lókè àròpín àpẹẹrẹ tí a ṣàtúnṣe nígbà tí a bá ti yọ àwọn àpẹẹrẹ àjèjì kúrò nínú àpẹẹrẹ náà. Fún àpẹẹrẹ, Ìpín Ọgọ́rùn-ún Ìyàtọ̀ ti 100%% lórí àròpín tí a ṣàtúnṣe ti 50 yóò yọ àpẹẹrẹ èyíkéyìí tí ó ju iye 100 lọ kúrò lórí àwòrán (graph)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Iye Àwọn Àyàtọ̀ Àṣejù Variance"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Iye yìí dúró fún iye àwọn àpẹẹrẹ ìpíndọ́gba gíga àti kékeré tí a máa yọ kúrò nínú àkójọpọ̀ àpẹẹrẹ kí a tó ṣírò Ìpíndọ́gba Ìyàtọ̀ (Variance Average).  Tí o bá yan iye àyàtọ̀ 5, a ó yọ ìpíndọ́gba 5 tó ga jù àti 5 tó kéré jù kúrò."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "%d Àwọn Àpẹẹrẹ Gíga/Kékeré"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Ìparun Púpọ̀ Jùlọ Fún RRA Kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Ìdíyelé yìí dúró fún iye òkè gíga tó pọ̀ jùlọ tí a ó yọ kúrò nínú RRA Àwòrán."

