#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Nígbà tí ìṣòro bá ṣẹlẹ̀, a gbani níyànjú gidigidi pé kí o pa káṣì aṣàwárí rẹ rẹ́, kí o ti aṣàwárí rẹ pa lẹ́yìn náà kí o tún ṣí i (kì í ṣe táàbù tí Cacti wà nìkan) kí o sì tún gbìyànjú, kí o tó fi ìṣòro tó Ẹgbẹ́ Cacti létí"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Ní ìgbà díẹ̀, a ti gba ìròyìn láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn olùlò tí wọ́n ní àwọn ìṣòro kéékèèké nítorí àwọn àyípadà nínú kóòdù. Àwọn ìṣòro wọ̀nyí ń ṣẹlẹ̀ nítorí pé aṣàwárí ń pa kóòdù ṣáájú ìgbéga mọ́, bó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé a ti gbé ìgbésẹ̀ láti dín àǹfààní èyí kù, ó ṣì lè ṣẹlẹ̀. Tí o bá nílò ìtọ́nisọ́nà lórí bí o ṣe lè pa káṣì aṣàwárí rẹ rẹ́, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> jẹ́ ibi ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ tó dára."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Tí o bá ṣì ń ní ìṣòro lẹ́yìn tí o ti pa káṣì rẹ rẹ́ tí o sì tún aṣàwárí rẹ ṣí, jọ̀wọ́ fi ìṣòro náà tó wa létí a ó sì gbìyànjú láti ṣàwárí ohun tó fà á."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Ìdàpadà sílẹ̀ láti <strong>%1$s</strong> sí <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Ó dà bí ẹni pé o ń dápadà sílẹ̀ sí ẹ̀yà ìṣáájú kan. Àwọn àyípadà ìbùdó ìwádìí tí a ṣe fún ẹ̀yà tuntun kò ní padà sẹ́yìn, ó sì <i>lè</i> fa àwọn ìṣòro."

