#: lib/spikekill.php
msgid "FATAL: Standard Deviation must be a positive integer."
msgstr "ÀṢÌṢE PÀTÀKÌ: Ìyàtọ̀ Ìwọ̀n gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ nọ́ńbà odidi tí ó ju odo lọ."

