#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Default collation used by the server when creating databases and tables."
msgstr "Ìṣètò ìfiwéra àkọ́kọ́ tí sáfà ń lò nígbà tí ó bá ń ṣẹ̀dá àwọn ibùdó-dátà àti àwọn tábìlì."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "e.g. utf8mb4_unicode_ci, utf8mb4_general_ci."
msgstr "fún àpẹẹrẹ utf8mb4_unicode_ci, utf8mb4_general_ci."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Default character set used by the server."
msgstr "Àkójọ àwọn lẹ́tà àkọ́kọ́ tí sáfà ń lò."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "e.g. utf8mb4, utf8, latin1."
msgstr "fún àpẹẹrẹ utf8mb4, utf8, latin1."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Character set the client uses when sending statements to the server."
msgstr "Àkójọ àwọn lẹ́tà tí kláyẹ́ǹtì ń lò nígbà tí ó bá ń fi àwọn àṣẹ ránṣẹ́ sí sáfà."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum number of simultaneous client connections permitted."
msgstr "Iye gíga jùlọ ti àwọn ìsopọ̀ kláyẹ́ǹtì lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà tí a gbà láyè."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; default 151. Allow enough for the pollers plus user logins."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà odidi; àkọ́kọ́ ni 151. Fi àyè tó pọ̀ tó sílẹ̀ fún àwọn olùṣèwádìí àti ìwọlé àwọn olùlò."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy name for the open-table cache; renamed to table_open_cache."
msgstr "Orúkọ àtijọ́ fún àpamọ́ tábìlì ṣíṣí; a yí i padà sí table_open_cache."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer. Use table_open_cache on modern servers."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà odidi. Lo table_open_cache lórí àwọn sẹ́fà òde òní."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum size of one packet or any generated/intermediate string."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n tó ga jù lọ fún páàkẹ́ẹ̀tì kan tàbí okùn ọ̀rọ̀ èyíkéyìí tí a ṣẹ̀dá tàbí ti àárín."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; keep at or above 16M for remote pollers."
msgstr "Báìtì; jẹ́ kó wà ní tàbí kó ju 16M lọ fún àwọn olùṣèwádìí òkèèrè."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum size to which user-created MEMORY tables may grow."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n tó ga jù lọ tí àwọn tábìlì MEMORY tí olùlò ṣẹ̀dá lè dàgbà dé."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; sized relative to total system memory."
msgstr "Báìtì; a fi ìwọ̀n rẹ̀ wé àpapọ̀ ìrántí ètò náà."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum size of internal in-memory temporary tables before they spill to disk."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n tó ga jù lọ fún àwọn tábìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ inú ìrántí kí wọ́n tó dà sí orí díìsìkì."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; a larger value keeps temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Báìtì; iye tó pọ̀ sí i máa ń pa àwọn tábìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ mọ́ sínú ìrántí."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Minimum per-join buffer size for joins that do not use indexes."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n bọ́fà tó kéré jù lọ fún ìdàpọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan fún àwọn ìdàpọ̀ tí kò lo àtọ́ka."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; per-connection allocation, default 262144."
msgstr "Báìtì; ìpín fún ìsopọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan, àìyípadà 262144."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Per-session buffer allocated for sorts (ORDER BY / GROUP BY)."
msgstr "Bọ́fà fún ìgbà ìṣe kọ̀ọ̀kan tí a pín fún títò (ORDER BY / GROUP BY)."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; per-connection allocation, default 2097152."
msgstr "Báìtì; ìpín fún ìsopọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan, àìyípadà 2097152."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Store each InnoDB table and its indexes in its own .ibd tablespace file."
msgstr "Fi tábìlì InnoDB kọ̀ọ̀kan àti àwọn àtọ́ka rẹ̀ pamọ́ sínú fáìlì ààyè tábìlì .ibd tirẹ̀."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; ON is recommended."
msgstr "ON tàbí OFF; a gbani nímọ̀ràn ON."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "InnoDB on-disk file format (Antelope or Barracuda); Barracuda is now the only format."
msgstr "Ìṣètò fáìlì InnoDB lórí díìsìkì (Antelope tàbí Barracuda); Barracuda nìkan ni ìṣètò tó wà báyìí."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Antelope, Barracuda."
msgstr "Antelope, Barracuda."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Allow index key prefixes longer than 767 bytes (requires the Barracuda format)."
msgstr "Gba àwọn ìṣáájú kọ́kọ́rọ́ àtọ́ka tó gùn ju 767 báìtì lọ láàyè (ó nílò ìṣètò Barracuda)."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON/1 or OFF/0; this behaviour is now always enabled."
msgstr "ON/1 tàbí OFF/0; ìwà yìí ti wà ní ṣíṣiṣẹ́ nígbà gbogbo báyìí."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Total memory InnoDB uses to cache table and index data."
msgstr "Àpapọ̀ ìrántí tí InnoDB ń lò láti fi détà tábìlì àti àtọ́ka pamọ́ sí àpamọ́."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; commonly 25%-80% of total system memory."
msgstr "Báìtì; lọ́pọ̀ ìgbà 25%-80% àpapọ̀ ìrántí ètò náà."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Write pages twice (the doublewrite buffer) to protect against partial page writes."
msgstr "Kọ àwọn ojú-ìwé ní ìgbà méjì (bọ́fà doublewrite) láti dáàbò bò ó lọ́wọ́ kíkọ ojú-ìwé àìpé."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF."
msgstr "ON tàbí OFF."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy pool for the InnoDB internal data dictionary and structures."
msgstr "Àdágún àtijọ́ fún ìwé-àtúmọ̀ détà àti ìṣètò inú InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; obsolete on modern servers."
msgstr "Báìtì; kò wúlò mọ́ lórí àwọn sẹ́fà òde òní."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds an InnoDB transaction waits for a row lock before giving up."
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí ìṣẹ̀ṣe InnoDB kan fi ń dúró de ìtìpa ìlà kan kí ó tó jáwọ́."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds; default 50."
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá; àìyípadà 50."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Method used to flush data and log files to disk."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà tí a lò láti fọ détà àti àwọn fáìlì àkọsílẹ̀ sí orí díìsìkì."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "O_DIRECT, fsync, O_DSYNC, and similar."
msgstr "O_DIRECT, fsync, O_DSYNC, àti irú wọn."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Controls how the redo log is written and flushed at transaction commit."
msgstr "Ń ṣàkóso bí a ṣe ń kọ àti bí a ṣe ń fọ àkọsílẹ̀ àtúnṣe nígbà ìparí ìṣẹ̀ṣe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "0, 1, or 2."
msgstr "0, 1, tàbí 2."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy single setting for InnoDB file I/O threads, replaced by the read/write I/O thread settings."
msgstr "Ètò kan ṣoṣo àtijọ́ fún àwọn okùn I/O fáìlì InnoDB, tí a fi àwọn ètò okùn I/O kíkà/kíkọ rọ́pò rẹ̀."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; superseded by innodb_read_io_threads and innodb_write_io_threads."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà odidi; innodb_read_io_threads àti innodb_write_io_threads ti rọ́pò rẹ̀."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Write and flush the InnoDB redo log every N seconds."
msgstr "Kọ kí o sì fọ àkọsílẹ̀ àtúnṣe InnoDB ní gbogbo ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá N."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds (1-2700); default 1."
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá (1-2700); àìyípadà 1."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of I/O threads used for read operations in InnoDB."
msgstr "Iye àwọn okùn I/O tí a lò fún àwọn iṣẹ́ kíkà nínú InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "1-64; default 4."
msgstr "1-64; àìyípadà 4."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of I/O threads used for write operations in InnoDB."
msgstr "Iye àwọn okùn I/O tí a lò fún àwọn iṣẹ́ kíkọ nínú InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of regions the InnoDB buffer pool is divided into."
msgstr "Iye àwọn agbègbè tí a pín àdágún bọ́fà InnoDB sí."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "1-64; MariaDB removed this in 10.6."
msgstr "1-64; MariaDB yọ èyí kúrò ní 10.6."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Estimated I/O operations per second available to InnoDB background tasks."
msgstr "Ìṣirò iṣẹ́ I/O fún ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá kan tó wà fún àwọn iṣẹ́ ẹ̀yìn InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; use higher values for SSD/NVMe storage."
msgstr "Nọ́ńbà odidi; lo àwọn iye tó ga sí i fún ìpamọ́ SSD/NVMe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum IOPS InnoDB may use when flushing falls behind."
msgstr "IOPS tó ga jù lọ tí InnoDB lè lò nígbà tí fífọ bá sẹ́yìn."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Flush neighbouring dirty pages in the same extent when flushing a page."
msgstr "Fọ àwọn ojú-ìwé ẹ̀gbẹ́ tó dọ̀tí nínú ààyè kan náà nígbà tí o bá ń fọ ojú-ìwé kan."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "0, 1, or 2; use 0 on SSD storage."
msgstr "0, 1, tàbí 2; lo 0 lórí ìpamọ́ SSD."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Use hardware atomic writes (MariaDB) so the doublewrite buffer can be safely disabled."
msgstr "Lo kíkọ àtọ́míìkì ohun-èlò (MariaDB) kí a lè pa bọ́fà doublewrite láìléwu."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; MariaDB only."
msgstr "ON tàbí OFF; MariaDB nìkan."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Enforce strict snapshot isolation for InnoDB transactions."
msgstr "Fi ìdánìkanwà àwòrán kíákíá tó muna dúró fún àwọn ìṣẹ̀ṣe InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; back-ported to MariaDB 10.6.18+, 10.11.8+ and 11.4.2+. Set OFF for the Cacti poller."
msgstr "ON tàbí OFF; a gbé e padà sẹ́yìn sí MariaDB 10.6.18+, 10.11.8+ àti 11.4.2+. Ṣètò sí OFF fún olùṣèwádìí Cacti."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Removed"
msgstr "Ti yọ kúrò"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "Ti di àlòkù"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Not applicable to this engine"
msgstr "Kò bá ẹ́ńjìnnì yìí mu"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Supported"
msgstr "Ní àtìlẹ́yìn"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Variable Capability Matrix"
msgstr "Àtẹ Agbára Oníyípadà %s"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Support by engine and version for each Cacti-recommended variable"
msgstr "Àtìlẹ́yìn nípa ẹ́ńjìnnì àti ẹ̀yà fún oníyípadà kọ̀ọ̀kan tí Cacti dámọ̀ràn"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Oníyípadà"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Available settings:"
msgstr "Àwọn ètò tó wà:"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "N/A - Not applicable to this engine"
msgstr "N/A - Kò bá ẹ́ńjìnnì yìí mu"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MariaDB 10.5+ and MySQL 8.0+ are the recommended, supported releases (for example, the default database streams on Rocky Linux 9). Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MariaDB 10.5+ àti MySQL 8.0+ ni àwọn ìtẹ̀jáde tí a dábàá, tí a sì ń ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún (fún àpẹẹrẹ, àwọn ṣíṣàn ibi ìpamọ́ dátà àkọ́bẹ̀rẹ̀ lórí Rocky Linux 9). Rí i dájú pé o lo ìtẹ̀jáde tuntun jùlọ síbẹ̀ èyí tí ó yanjú ìṣòro ìsopọ̀mọ́ra ìpele kékeré tó ti pẹ́ tí ó ń fa ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìṣòro fún ìgbẹ́kẹ̀lé spine."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "A dámọ̀ràn GAN-AN pé kí o mú InnoDB ṣiṣẹ́ nínú ẹ̀yà %s èyíkéyìí tó ju 5.5.3 lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ń lo Cacti pẹ̀lú àwọn èdè mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí Gẹ̀ẹ́sì, ó ṣe pàtàkì láti lo irú ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ utf8mb4_unicode_ci nítorí àwọn lẹ́tà kan máa ń gba ju báìtì kan ṣoṣo lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ń lo Cacti pẹ̀lú àwọn èdè mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí Gẹ̀ẹ́sì, ó ṣe pàtàkì láti lo àkójọ lẹ́tà utf8mb4 nítorí àwọn lẹ́tà kan máa ń gba ju báìtì kan ṣoṣo lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "A dámọ̀ràn pé kí o mú InnoDB ṣiṣẹ́ nínú ẹ̀yà %s èyíkéyìí tó ju 5.1 lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú iye ìwọlé àti lílo olùkójọ détà spine, %s yóò nílò ọ̀pọ̀ ìsopọ̀. Ìṣirò fún spine ni: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), lẹ́yìn náà o gbọ́dọ̀ fi ààyè sílẹ̀ fún àwọn ìsopọ̀ olùlò, èyí tí yóò yí padà ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú iye àwọn àkáùntì ìwọlé lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Mímú kí àpamọ́ tábìlì tóbi sí i túmọ̀ sí iṣẹ́ ṣíṣí/títì fáìlì tó dín kù nígbà tí o bá ń lo innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú àwọn agbára ìṣèwádìí òkèèrè, ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ détà ni a ó mú ṣọ̀kan láti sẹ́fà àkọ́kọ́ sí àwọn olùṣèwádìí òkèèrè. Nítorí náà, jẹ́ kí iye yìí wà ní tàbí kó ju 16M lọ."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Cacti Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Bí o bá ń lo Cacti Performance Booster tí o sì yan ẹ́ńjìnì ìpamọ́ ìrántí, o ní láti ṣọ́ra láti ṣàn àpamọ́ Performance Booster rẹ dànù kí ètò náà tó parí ààyè tábìlì ìrántí.  A ń ṣe èyí lọ́nà méjì: àkọ́kọ́, dídín ìwọ̀n òpó àbájáde rẹ kù sí ìwọ̀n tó tọ́ gan-an.  Òpó yìí wà nínú àwọn tábìlì poller_output, àti poller_output_boost.  Ohun kejì tí o lè ṣe ni láti ya ìrántí púpọ̀ sí i sọ́tọ̀ fún àwọn tábìlì ìrántí.  A ti yan ìdíyelé àbá ti 10%% ti ìrántí ètò láìròtẹ́lẹ̀, ṣùgbọ́n bí o bá ń lo àwọn àwo SSD, tàbí tí o ní ètò kékeré kan, o lè kọbi ara sí àbá yìí tàbí kí o yan ẹ́ńjìnì ìpamọ́ mìíràn.  O lè rí ìlò tí a retí fún àwọn tábìlì Performance Booster lábẹ́ Kọ́nsólù -> Àwọn Ohun Èlò Ètò -> Wo Ipò Boost."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ń ṣe àwọn ìbéèrè abẹ́lé, níní ìwọ̀n tábìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ tó tóbi jù yóò jẹ́ kí àwọn tábìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ wọ̀nyẹn wà nínú ìrántí."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ń ṣe ìsopọ̀, tí wọ́n bá kéré ju ìwọ̀n yìí lọ, a ó pa wọ́n mọ́ sínú ìrántí a kò sì ní kọ wọ́n sínú fáìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ rárá. Nítorí pé èyí jẹ́ ìpínkiri ìrántí fún ìsopọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan, a gbọ́dọ̀ ṣọ́ra láti má ṣe gbé e sókè jù. Àpapọ̀ join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + ìrántí pàtàkì MySQL/MariaDB gbọ́dọ̀ wà lábẹ́ 80%. Tí ìmọ̀ràn náà bá jẹ́ òdì, o gbọ́dọ̀ dín èyí kù àti tàbí sort_buffer_size títí tí ìmọ̀ràn náà yóò fi bá ìrántí tí a fàyè gbà mu."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ń lo ìpamọ́ InnoDB, ó ṣe pàtàkì láti pa àwọn ààyè tábìlì rẹ mọ́ lọ́tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀.  Èyí ń mú kí ìṣàkóso àwọn tábìlì rọrùn sí i fún àwọn olùlò %s fún ìgbà pípẹ́.  Bí o bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú èyí ní ìpìlẹ̀ tí ó wà ní pípa lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́, o lè ṣí lọ sí ìpamọ́ fún fáìlì kọ̀ọ̀kan nípa ṣíṣí àbùdá náà sílẹ̀, lẹ́yìn náà kí o ṣiṣẹ́ gbólóhùn alter lórí gbogbo àwọn tábìlì InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Cacti tables."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ń lo innodb_file_per_table, ó ṣe pàtàkì láti ṣètò innodb_file_format sí Barracuda.  Ètò yìí yóò gba àwọn atọ́ka gígùn jù lọ láyè tí ó ṣe pàtàkì fún àwọn tábìlì Cacti kan."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Bí àwọn tábìlì rẹ bá ní àwọn atọ́ka tó tóbi púpọ̀, o gbọ́dọ̀ ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú innodb_file_format ti Barracuda àti innodb_large_prefix tó dọ́gba pẹ̀lú 1.  Àìṣe èyí lè yọrí sí àwọn àfikún tí kò lè ṣẹ̀dá àwọn tábìlì dáadáa."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "InnoDB yóò di ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ tábìlì àti àtọ́ka mú nínú ìrántí ètò bí ó ti ṣeé ṣe tó. Nítorí náà, o gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ kí innodb_buffer_pool tóbi tó láti di ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ tábìlì àti àtọ́ka mú nínú ìrántí. Ṣíṣe àyẹ̀wò ìwọ̀n àpò /var/lib/mysql/cacti yóò ràn ọ́ lọ́wọ́ láti pinnu iye yìí. À ń dábàá 25%% ti àpapọ̀ ìrántí ètò rẹ, ṣùgbọ́n àwọn ohun tí o nílò yóò yàtọ̀ ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú ìwọ̀n ètò rẹ."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Cacti instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Ètò yìí gbọ́dọ̀ wà ní ON àyàfi tí àpẹẹrẹ Cacti rẹ bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ZFS tàbí FusionI/O tí àwọn méjèèjì ní ìkọsílẹ̀ inú láti farada ìkọlù ètò lójijì. Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, tí o bá ní iná mànàmáná tó dára púpọ̀, tí ètò rẹ kò sì sábà jábọ́ tí o sì ní àwọn àfẹ̀hìntì, yíyí ètò yìí sí OFF lè fún ọ ní ìlọsíwájú tó fẹ́rẹ̀ tó 50% nínú iṣẹ́ ibi ìpamọ́ dátà."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Ibi yìí ni a ti ń tọ́jú metadata. Tí o bá ní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ tábìlì, yóò wúlò láti mú èyí pọ̀ sí i."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Àwọn ìbéèrè burúkú kò gbọdọ̀ fa kí ibi ìpamọ́ data jábọ́ fún àwọn ẹlòmíràn.  Pa àwọn ìbéèrè wọ̀nyí kí wọ́n tó pa ètò rẹ."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Iṣẹ́ I/O tó ga jù lọ máa ń ṣẹlẹ̀ nígbà tí o bá lo ọ̀nà O_DIRECT láti ṣe flush àwọn ojú-ìwé."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Ṣíṣètò iye yìí sí 2 túmọ̀ sí pé ìwọ yóò máa ṣe flush gbogbo àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá kọ̀ọ̀kan dípò ní àkókò commit.  Èyí ń gba %s láyè láti má ṣe kọ data léraléra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ibi ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ètò tí ó ní ìwà io gíga."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti %1$s %2$s, o lè darí bí %3$s ṣe máa ń ṣe flush àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ sí orí disk léraléra tó.  Àìyípadà ni ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá 1, ṣùgbọ́n nínú àwọn ètò I/O gíga ṣíṣètò sí iye tó ju 1 lọ lè jẹ́ kí I/O disk tẹ̀lé ara wọn dáadáa"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ibi ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ read io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ètò tí ó ní ìwà io gíga.  Ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹ̀yà MariaDB/MySQL rẹ, iye yìí lè ga dé 64.  Ṣùgbọ́n gbìyànjú láti jẹ́ kí nọ́ńbà náà kéré sí àpapọ̀ àwọn SMT thread rẹ lórí sáfà ibi ìpamọ́ data."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ibi ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ write io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ètò tí ó ní ìwà io gíga.  Ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹ̀yà MariaDB/MySQL rẹ, iye yìí lè ga dé 64.  Ṣùgbọ́n gbìyànjú láti jẹ́ kí nọ́ńbà náà kéré sí àpapọ̀ àwọn SMT thread rẹ lórí sáfà ibi ìpamọ́ data."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s yóò pín innodb_buffer_pool sí àwọn agbègbè ìrántí láti mú iṣẹ́ sunwọ̀n sí i fún àwọn ẹ̀yà MariaDB tí ó kéré sí 10.5.  Iye tó ga jù lọ ni 64, ṣùgbọ́n kò gbọdọ̀ ju iye àwọn CPU core/thread lọ.  Nígbà tí innodb_buffer_pool rẹ bá kéré sí 1GB, o yẹ kí o lo ìwọ̀n pool tí a pín sí 128MB.  Tẹ̀síwájú láti lo ìṣirò yìí títí dé iye tó ga jù lọ ti àwọn CPU core tàbí 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s yóò pín innodb_buffer_pool sí àwọn agbègbè ìrántí láti mú iṣẹ́ sunwọ̀n sí i fún àwọn ẹ̀yà MySQL títí dé àti pẹ̀lú MySQL 8.0.  Iye tó ga jù lọ ni 64, ṣùgbọ́n kò gbọdọ̀ ju iye àwọn CPU core/thread lọ.  Nígbà tí innodb_buffer_pool rẹ bá kéré sí 1GB, o yẹ kí o lo ìwọ̀n pool tí a pín sí 128MB.  Tẹ̀síwájú láti lo ìṣirò yìí títí dé iye tó ga jù lọ ti àwọn CPU core tàbí 64."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Tí o bá ní àwọn disk SSD, lo àbá yìí.  Tí o bá ní àwọn hard drive gidi, lo 200 * iye àwọn drive tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ nínú àkójọpọ̀ náà.  Tí o bá ń lo NVMe tàbí PCIe Flash, àwọn nọ́ńbà tó tóbi púpọ̀ tó lè ga dé 100000 ni a lè lò."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Tí o bá ní àwọn disk SSD, lo àbá yìí.  Tí o bá ní àwọn hard drive gidi, lo 2000 * iye àwọn drive tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ nínú àkójọpọ̀ náà.  Tí o bá ń lo NVMe tàbí PCIe Flash, àwọn nọ́ńbà tó tóbi púpọ̀ tó lè ga dé 200000 ni a lè lò."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, set this to 0. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Tí o bá ní àwọn disk SSD, ṣètò èyí sí 0. Bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́, má ṣe ṣètò ìtò yìí."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ibi ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ read io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ètò tí ó ní ìwà io gíga."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Pẹ̀lú ibi ìpamọ́ irú SSD òde òní, níní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ write io ṣe àǹfààní fún àwọn ètò tí ó ní ìwà io gíga."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ń lo MariaDB 10.2.4 àti jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ, ìtò yìí yẹ kí ó wà ní pípa tí atomic writes bá wà ní ṣíṣiṣẹ́.  Nítorí náà, jọ̀wọ́ mú atomic writes ṣiṣẹ́ dípò double write buffer nítorí yóò mú iṣẹ́ pọ̀ sí i."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Nígbà tí o bá ń lo MariaDB 10.2.4 àti jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ, o lè lo atomic writes dípò doublewrite buffer láti mú iṣẹ́ pọ̀ sí i."

